	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Si nihil scribo (reverende in Christo pater), tu omnino id <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ita accipias me nihil habere, quod tua cognitione <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>dignum iudicem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">De concilio quod scribam, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ne verbum quidem habeo, nec est apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>qui verum resciri possit, ne ipsi quidem pfaffi; <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nam per alios, si quid esset, ex illis expiscari liceret.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Eos <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName> cessare non est verisimile; timeo <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tamen non prius experturos, quid machinentur, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quam audituros.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Responsum, quod nostris superiori <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mense <placeName ref="l232">Oeniponti</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><placeName ref="l232">Innsbruck</placeName>.</note> datum, legi et satisfecit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nunc pro certo audio Caesareanos illis in partibus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vicinis <placeName ref="l638">Engadinensibus</placeName> praesidia firmare contra <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pacta et pollicita.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quid id portendat, nescio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Hoc scio animos <placeName ref="l638">Engadinensium</placeName> ad indignas <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>illas voces, quas Caesareani iactare dicuntur, plane <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>exasperatos et ita concitatos, ut, nisi modestia <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quorundam seniorum cohiberentur, incursionem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>in illos alteros facerent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Cupio scire, quid <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName> paretur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Qui <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> veniunt <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>eadem prope referunt, ut tu in scheda annotasti.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Quaeso, si quid de <placeName ref="l830">Anglico</placeName> aspparatu certi habetur, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nos non celes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sunt, qui affirment, <persName ref="p18477">Caesarem <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Ferdinandum</persName> <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> expectari.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>operam suam <persName ref="p8315">Condensi</persName> denegarint, video, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quibus se sannis exposituri sint.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Aut domi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mansum oportuit aut fortiter rem gerere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Sunt iam nunc, qui clamitant eos <placeName ref="l301">Lugduno</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>inhiasse, quod ego nunquam crediderim, et invitus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>talia audio; sed multo graviora audient, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>si infecta re domum redierint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Es wäre guͦ<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>tt kriegen, wen einer alwäg bürgen darumb <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>hätte, wär gewünnen wurde.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Video nos <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>per omnia lentos; itaque quod ad humana auxilia <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>attinet, victoriae spem omnem deposui.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>enim ignavius fieri poterat, quam a nostris fit?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Sed quod ad causam ipsam et opem divinam, in optima <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>adhuc spe sum.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Alter c[onsul] <persName ref="p3196">Tscharnerus</persName> septimanas aliquot <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>abfuit; hodie expectatur; lavit enim in <placeName ref="l151">Fideris</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si quid <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ille ex <persName>Dietägio</persName> praefecto, qui vicinus illis partibus, audiam, ut puto, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>hoc vesperi.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Alter in comitiis Eremitanis illis fuit; <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>discedens misit filium (discessit statim a nuptiis), si quid <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>vellem, quod curaret, iuberem; rediens itidem e vestigio <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>misit filium nunciatum, quid actum in comitiis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Post gravem <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>meam concionem tamen omnia potest contorquere et devorare <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>et mire est blandulus pro more.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quid faciam?</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Der <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ritt hat mich mit denen hälen katzen bschissen.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Salva sit tua paternita<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>s!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 17. augusti anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, suo in Chri<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sto patri honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
